; claude: the CAD applications (CATALOG.md's section, and plan_cad.md):
; the drawings that are models rather than pictures -- geometry that
; keeps its own rules. TinySketchpad (Sketchpad, 1963), over
; appkits/sketch; TinyAutoCAD (AutoCAD Release 12, 1992), over
; appkits/cad; TinySketchup (SketchUp, 2000), over appkits/pushpull.
; Laid out like graphics/: the programs here, software/ for the golden
; frames, web/ for the browser.
;
; What else it might contain, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - a parametric solid modeller (CATIA 1977, Pro/ENGINEER 1988): the
;    history of features, re-run when a dimension changes.
(executables
  (names TinySketchpad TinyAutoCAD TinySketchup)
  (libraries
    elm_playground
    gui ; Widget, the knobs and the switch (TinySketchpad)
    appkit_sketch ; Sketch, Relax
    appkit_cad ; Cad_geom, Cad_drawing, Cad_edit, Cad_snap, Dxf, Cad_session
    caps ; the DXF files' authority to be written and read
    appkit_pushpull ; Skp_model, Skp_infer, Skp_view, Bsp (TinySketchup)
    graphics_3d_geometry ; Vec3, Camera
    appkit_document ; Undo
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
)
